            </p>

            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; width: 100%; max-width: 500px;">
                <button onclick="handleConsentDecline()" style="
                    flex:1; padding:12px; border-radius:10px;
                    background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
                    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); cursor:pointer; transition:0.2s;
                    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
                " onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.2)';this.style.color='rgba(255,255,255,0.8)'"
